==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|усынови́ть|-е́ние}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|усыновле́ние|pos=n}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|усыновле́ние}}

# [[adoption]] {{gloss|act of adopting, or state of being adopted}}

====Usage notes====
* The term is derived from {{l|ru|сын|gloss=son}}, so originally it meant to make someone one's son. It is also used as a generic term for adoption. To refer to female adoption specifically, use {{l|ru|удочере́ние}}

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|усыновле́ние}}

====Related terms====
* {{l|ru|усыновля́ть}}, {{l|ru|усынови́ть}}
* {{l|ru|усыновитель}}, {{l|ru|усыновительница}}
